{#- The Compose env file (H5, *Secrets*): one single-quoted line per key the project reads.
    Compose's dotenv parser reads a single-quoted value literally, so `$` and ` #` in a value
    survive. `homelab-secrets` refuses a value that holds `'` or a newline (`format: dotenv`).
    `secret_placeholders` maps each key the output declares to its placeholder. -#}
{% for key, placeholder in secret_placeholders | dictsort %}
{{ key }}='{{ placeholder }}'
{% endfor %}
